;--------------------------------------------------------------------
; PAGES 2/3  per-player object state  (rev 2 addresses)
; BNKSEL ($3C04) bit 7 swaps page 2 and page 3, so the same
; addresses address whichever player is up.
;--------------------------------------------------------------------
